herdr-screen modifications relative to Herdr:
  - GNU screen keybinding defaults: prefix is ctrl+a and the last-tab
    toggle (prefix+prefix) is bound by default (keys.last_tab patch).
  - Self-update and version/manifest checks are disabled by default;
    updates are distributed as packages (RPM, deb, AUR).
  - Package and binary identity: herdr-screen (version 0.1.0).

